---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Base title="Subscribe" description="Get The AILEEN Edit — a weekly letter on what's worth your time in travel, style, and everything in between.">

  <section class="article-header">
    <h1>The AILEEN Edit</h1>
    <p class="article-meta">A weekly letter on what's worth your time</p>
  </section>

  <div class="article-body">

    <p>Every week, I send one email with the things that are actually worth knowing — the restaurant that just earned a permanent spot in my rotation, the hotel that exceeded expectations, the piece I'm adding to my closet, the recipe I made three times this month.</p>

    <p>It's personal, curated, and short. No filler. No sponsored content pretending to be editorial. Just what I'd tell a friend if she asked, "What's good right now?"</p>

    <h2>What you'll get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>The feature</strong> — one deep guide or editorial worth reading this week</li>
      <li><strong>Worth your time</strong> — 2-3 picks across travel, style, and food</li>
      <li><strong>The Edit</strong> — curated product finds, restaurant discoveries, travel intel</li>
      <li><strong>A personal note</strong> — what I'm thinking about, working on, or going back to</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="subscribe-form-section">
      <form class="newsletter-form subscribe-page-form" data-newsletter="true">
        <input type="email" placeholder="Your email address" aria-label="Email address" required />
        <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p class="newsletter-privacy">We respect your privacy. Unsubscribe anytime. No spam, ever.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Start here</h2>
    <p>New to AILEEN? These are the guides worth reading first:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={`${base}/travel/best-restaurants-miami/`}>Best Restaurants in Miami — A Local's Guide</a></li>
      <li><a href={`${base}/style/quiet-luxury-brands/`}>Quiet Luxury Brands Worth Knowing</a></li>
      <li><a href={`${base}/travel/boston-travel-guide/`}>Boston Travel Guide</a></li>
    </ul>

  </div>

</Base>
